      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Standard: Codex worker owns its review cycle, then returns to architect.\nUI-first: dedicated Codex UI review; UX intent stays human-approved.\nStack: backend/API PR → wired UI PR; accept together before merge.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Standard: Codex worker owns its review cycle, then returns to architect.\nUI-first: dedicated Codex UI review; UX intent stays human-approved.\nStack: backend/API PR → wired UI PR; accept together before merge.",
